close_reason: "Verified by the orchestrator: pm-rl#107 merged as 105233a from head 61934f5. On that exact head the full release gates passed with the unchanged 300-second timeout and unchanged coverage thresholds: test (22) 1h40m, test (26) 41m, Bun release (26) 1h11m (run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/41574057945). Cause: ensurePersistentTypes reinstalled the schema on every call; 3c320c9 memoizes it per client, and test/loop.test.ts bounds schemaAddType calls at RL_ITEM_TYPES.length*2 (243 calls on revert, verified)."
